# Local IPOs, first part: the daily scan reads every zoned business and counts how long each has
# stayed healthy. Forgets the counts in memory, scans twice with the rule lowered to two healthy
# days, and expects no candidate after one scan and some after two. Nothing lists; the save is
# only written when the city saves, and the player's flag is put back.
name local ipos: the daily scan counts healthy days and finds candidates
local-ipos on
ipo-healthy-days 2
ipo-forget
ipo-scan
expect-log ipo scanned
expect-ipo-candidates none
ipo-scan
expect-ipo-candidates some
cleanup:
local-ipos restore
